<div class="thesis">
  <div class="thesis-content">
    <p class="reveal lead">You don't need another screen.</p>
    <p class="reveal">
      Fountain is a small, considered object. You wear one version on your body.
      You set the other on a desk. Together they form an ambient AI — projecting
      useful intelligence into the world where you actually live, instead of
      pulling you back into a phone.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      A turn arrow on your handlebars when you're somewhere new. The freshness
      of an avocado, on the avocado. A doorbell on a door without one. A meeting
      on the table you're already sitting at.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal accent">
      The screen looks back at you. <em>Fountain looks with you.</em>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .thesis {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(48px, 10vh, 120px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px);
  }
  .thesis-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .thesis-content p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.6em;
    max-width: 65ch;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .thesis-content p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .thesis-content .lead {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .thesis-content .accent {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .thesis-content .accent em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 1000ms var(--ease-out-refined),
                transform 1000ms var(--ease-out-refined);
  }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 150ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 300ms; }
  :global([data-revealed="true"]) .reveal:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 480ms; }
</style>
